WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.165
Structure an accessible page using semantic HTML.

00:00:05.165 --> 00:00:09.585
Place meaningful content inside main and use descriptive link text.

00:00:10.585 --> 00:00:13.385
Which element identifies the main page content?

00:00:13.385 --> 00:00:16.585
main identifies the dominant content of the document.
